cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or data, please cite it using the metadata in this file,
  and cite the accompanying paper.
title: >-
  Sybil Detection on Public Blockchains via XGBoost and Gas Provision Network
  Analysis — code and data
type: software
version: "TBD"
authors:
  - given-names: Thuat
    family-names: Do
  - given-names: Scott
    family-names: Imig
  - given-names: Thanh Duc
    family-names: Phan
repository-code: "https://github.com/paven86/layerzero_xgboost"
abstract: >-
  Code and input data that train and evaluate XGBoost, LightGBM, random forest and
  logistic regression classifiers, and a cross-model ensemble, on 434,786 Ethereum
  addresses to identify Sybil wallets in the LayerZero airdrop of June 2024, using
  transaction features and features of the gas provision network.
keywords:
  - Sybil detection
  - airdrop
  - LayerZero
  - Ethereum
  - gas provision network
  - XGBoost
